WEBVTT

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:02.957
Girls are afraid of ruining themselves,

00:04:02.981 --> 00:04:04.765
either through sport,

00:04:04.789 --> 00:04:05.940
play,

00:04:05.964 --> 00:04:07.115
tampon use

00:04:07.139 --> 00:04:08.441
or a sexual activity.

00:04:09.656 --> 00:04:13.229
We have curtailed their opportunities
and their freedoms.

00:04:14.213 --> 00:04:17.698
It's time we put an end
to the virginity fraud.

00:04:18.282 --> 00:04:21.253
It's time we break the myths
about the hymen

00:04:21.277 --> 00:04:22.902
once and for all.

00:04:24.267 --> 00:04:26.364
ESD: We are medical students,

00:04:26.388 --> 00:04:28.256
sexual health workers

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:31.780
and the authors
of "The Wonder Down Under."